Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Workspace Studio steps to start builds from a flow
 (Rule 1.5)

- Two Studio steps (Build DairyPill EOM / Shopify Sell Thru) with a Month input
- Quick read-only checks in the step; full build runs in the background via a
  one-off trigger and emails the link or the problem; one build at a time
- Falls back to building inside the step if background triggers are refused
- buildEOM/shopifyOnly now delegate to month-parameterised versions
- appsscript.json gains addOns.flows manifest; tests cover the Studio path
- SETUP.md section F, RULES.md 1.5, CLAUDE.md notes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
